 le bien-être. 

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:28.720 align:start position:0% line:82%
<c.magenta> ... </c>

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.080 align:start position:0% line:77%
<c.green> -Okay, very good afternoon, 
