<c.green> Okay, how are you, today ? </c>

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:36.840 line:82%
<c.green> In a good shape ? </c>

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.960 line:94%
<c.green> -YES. 
 
 -Okay, good. </c>

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:43.480 line:77%
<c.green> I will give you the documents 
 we're gonna study together today. </c>

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:49.160 line:82%
<c.green> -Thank you. </c>

